        "original_id": "8145759d-0f44-5dcf-970b-b03b6de4c167",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Hulk Hogan, Randy Savage, Miss Elizabeth, Lex Luger\n- Teams: The Mega Powers\n- Roles: valet, manager, professional wrestler\n\nFacts:\n- Miss Elizabeth was the professional wrestling name of Elizabeth Ann Hulette, an American professional wrestling manager and occasional professional wrestler born on November 19, 1960.\n- The Mega Powers consisted of Hulk Hogan and \"Macho Man\" Randy Savage, with Miss Elizabeth serving as their valet.\n- On-screen, Miss Elizabeth was portrayed as Randy Savage's manager, and her further relationship to him was not explained, although she was his real-life wife at the time.\n- Miss Elizabeth died from a drug and alcohol overdose on May 1, 2003, in the home she shared with wrestler Lex Luger.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
